  "description": "The native payload for Agora's voice effects and beautification extension (audio-beauty 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. The voice changers, equalisation presets and room-reverb effects — the chipmunk voice, the concert-hall reverb, the \"studio\" polish on a plain microphone. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.SetVoiceBeautifierPreset / SetAudioEffectPreset in the RTC binding.",
